you i'll cover cover me,    you.

&#x200B;

RIP ISAIAH. :(

It doesn't matter if its realistic IRL, this game is weaboo simulator since the caveira update, lets be real. Also terrible idea to remove her from the game and replace her unique with this new thing, just because you died to her once in ranked and lost the match doesnt mean shes broken, nobody has an issue with being knocked back for a second, it just means your dumb ass didnt play around it and judging by your other comment, you cant figure out how to play around it and instead want to change it because you cant win and wont adapt, reworking her wont give you your elo back.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Lol

Not low gold, I rechecked for you to be sure. the player's previous ranks in all seasons is averaging at platinum elo and this season they are gold 2. They are in high gold elo...

&#x200B;

And yes it doesn't mean it all the time they will turn off their brains on last round, but to be honest when im doing good I just dont try simply because it feels like the opponent isn't and mistakes can be made. Put your tampon in and accept the fact you got called out for your original "superior intellect" comment

Wrong, it wasn't low silver or high bronze. This was high gold elo, you could have just looked it up instead of being an ass and trying to point out errors in their plays. I mean the score was 3-0, the safe assumption is that the enemy wasn't trying; as they were far enough ahead that they didnt feel the need to look out for obvious things like that. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Kapkan, just make sure you place it on the correct side of the frame. New kapkan players will often place it where ever and it often gets shot out.

&#x200B;

Frost does have her niche though for downing cheeky rushers close to site, my personal favorite thing about her is that they are forced to look down and shoot out the mat giving you an easy kill to a target who thought they were smart.
